      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is a <tei:hi rend="italic">piyyut</tei:hi> (liturgical poem) which is intended to be recited at a brit. It is connected to my liturgy for a “chag hachnassah labrit” (available here). The explanation for the chag is also the basis for the piyyut. Translation into English by Shoshanna Gershenson, Maeera Schreiber and Aryeh Cohen.</tei:p>
